<title>POLAND: Boryszew sees 1997 net up to PLN 10.4 mln.</title>
<headline>Boryszew sees 1997 net up to PLN 10.4 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish chemical company Boryszew SA saw its 1997 net profit rising to 10.4 million zlotys, up from last year's 8.2-million, the company said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>Boryszew said it expected its sales to rise to 120.7 million zlotys from 99.9 million in 1996.</p>
<p>The company said its operating profit was expected to amount to 18.5 million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
